A '''Minos Hunter''' is a [[Mythological Creature]] that can be spawned from [[Griffin Burrows]] during the [[Mythological Ritual]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Minos Hunter''' can be spawned by digging up [[Griffin Burrows]] with a {{Item|Griffin Pet}} equipped.

